        "nivel_apoyo": "ejemplo_resuelto",
        "enunciado_md": "La tienda escolar necesita calcular el promedio de ventas diarias. El programa lee **n** y después **n** ventas (cada venta es un número entero), y muestra el promedio con dos decimales. Estudia la solución y explica con tus palabras por qué el acumulador empieza en cero.\n\n### Ejecución paso a paso\n\nAvanza línea por línea y observa cómo cambian las variables y la salida.\n\n```traza\ntitulo: Promedio de ventas diarias\nlenguaje: c\nentrada: 2\\n100\\n200\n---\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int n, venta, suma = 0;\n    scanf(\"%d\", &n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        scanf(\"%d\", &venta);\n        suma += venta;\n    }\n    printf(\"%.2f\\n\", (float)suma / n);\n    return 0;\n}\n---\n{\"l\":4,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[]}]}\n{\"l\":5,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"?\"],[\"venta\",\"?\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140723854726800,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140723854726812,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":6,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"?\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140723854726800,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140723854726812,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":7,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"?\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"],[\"i\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140723854726800,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140723854726812,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140723854726808,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":8,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"100\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"],[\"i\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140723854726800,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140723854726812,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140723854726808,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":6,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"100\"],[\"suma\",\"100\"],[\"i\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140723854726800,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140723854726812,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140723854726808,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":7,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"100\"],[\"suma\",\"100\"],[\"i\",\"1\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140723854726800,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140723854726812,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140723854726808,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"1\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":8,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"200\"],[\"suma\",\"100\"],[\"i\",\"1\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140723854726800,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"200\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140723854726812,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140723854726808,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"1\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":6,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"200\"],[\"suma\",\"300\"],[\"i\",\"1\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140723854726804,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\