    {
      "tipo": "soporte",
      "contenido": {
        "uid": "reg01-tc-s1",
        "clase_uid": "reg01-tc",
        "tipo": "modelo_mental",
        "titulo": "Cómo calcular el promedio de ventas",
        "cuerpo_md": "# La idea clave\n\nEl promedio de ventas se calcula sumando todas las ventas y dividiendo por el número de ventas. Para hacerlo en C, necesitamos leer las ventas, acumularlas en una variable y luego dividir por el total.\n\n## Una analogía\n\nImagina que estás contando los puntos en un juego: sumas cada punto y luego divides por el número de turnos para obtener el promedio.\n\n## Cómo funciona\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    A[\"suma = 0, n = 0\"] --> B{¿Leer n?}\n    B -- \"sí\" --> C[\"suma += venta; n++\"] --> B\n    B -- \"no\" --> D[\"promedio = suma / n\"]\n    D --> E[\"imprimir promedio\"]\n```\n\n## Ejemplo paso a paso\n\n```traza\ntitulo: Promedio de ventas diarias\nlenguaje: c\nentrada: 2\\n100\\n200\n---\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(void) {\n    int n, venta, suma = 0;\n    scanf(\"%d\", &n);\n    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n        scanf(\"%d\", &venta);\n        suma += venta;\n    }\n    printf(\"%.2f\\n\", (float)suma / n);\n    return 0;\n}\n---\n{\"l\":4,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[]}]}\n{\"l\":5,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"?\"],[\"venta\",\"?\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":6,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"?\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":7,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"?\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"],[\"i\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"?\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140737173444104,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":8,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"100\"],[\"suma\",\"0\"],[\"i\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140737173444104,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":6,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"100\"],[\"suma\",\"100\"],[\"i\",\"0\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140737173444104,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"0\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":7,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"100\"],[\"suma\",\"100\"],[\"i\",\"1\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140737173444104,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"1\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":8,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"200\"],[\"suma\",\"100\"],[\"i\",\"1\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"200\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"100\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140737173444104,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"1\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":6,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"200\"],[\"suma\",\"300\"],[\"i\",\"1\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"200\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"300\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"i\",\"d\":140737173444104,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"1\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":10,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"200\"],[\"suma\",\"300\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"200\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"300\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":11,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"200\"],[\"suma\",\"300\"]],\"s\":\"150.00\\n\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"200\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"300\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":12,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[[\"n\",\"2\"],[\"venta\",\"200\"],[\"suma\",\"300\"]],\"s\":\"\",\"m\":[{\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[{\"n\":\"n\",\"d\":140737173444100,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"2\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"venta\",\"d\":140737173444096,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"200\",\"tam\":4},{\"n\":\"suma\",\"d\":140737173444108,\"t\":\"valor\",\"x\":\"300\",\"tam\":4}]}]}\n{\"l\":12,\"f\":\"main\",\"v\":[],\"s\":\"\",\"fin\":true}\n```\n\n## Errores comunes\n\n| Error | Cómo evitarlo |\n|-------|----------------|\n| Dividir por cero | Asegúrate de que `n` no sea 0 antes de dividir |\n| Decimales incorrectos | Usa `float` para la división y `%.2f` para imprimir |\n| Olvidar leer `n` | Lee el número de ventas antes de empezar a leer las ventas |\n\n## En resumen\n\n- [ ] Leer el número de ventas\n- [ ] Sumar cada venta\n- [ ] Dividir por el número de ventas\n- [ ] Imprimir con dos decimales",
